              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அன்றைய — aṉṟaiya — \"of that day; that day's\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அன்றைய நாளிதழில் அந்தச் செய்தி வந்தது. aṉṟaiya nāḷitaḻil antac ceyti vantatu. That news appeared in that day's newspaper."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Like இன்றைய, today's, and நேற்றைய, yesterday's; only before a noun."
            }
          ]
        },
